SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Stories and Love Songs (Dinner\, Dance and Listen
 ing Party)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'm looking fo
 rward to sharing an evening of original music\, good conversation\, and gr
 eat company with all of you. Whether you're a fan of country\, folk\, rock
 \, singer-songwriter music\, or simply enjoy discovering something new mus
 ic\; I hope you'll find songs that make you smile\, think\, reminisce\, an
 d maybe even get up and dance.\n\nMost of all\, I hope this is an opportun
 ity to relax\, meet some friendly people\, and enjoy an experience that's 
 both entertaining\, uplifting and memorable.\n\n\\*Joined by my other grou
 ps too\; so we can anticipate a wonderful evening!\n\n**Location:** Smoke 
 Show - 744 Mt. Pleasant Rd.\nhttps://www.smokeshowbbqandbrew.com/\n**Date:
 ** Sunday July 26th\, 2026\n**Time:** Arrive between 6:30 pm and 7:00 pm (
 if you can)\n\\*Arrive a bit early too\; if you like to get settled in :)\
 n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter and 
 Producer)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Stories and Love Songs (Di
 nner\, Dance and Listening Party)**\n\nCome and enjoy an evening of origin
 al music in a relaxed\, friendly atmosphere. Whether you love country\, fo
 lk\, rock\, singer-songwriter music\, or simply discovering new artists\, 
 this is a chance to hear songs you won't find anywhere else\; while meetin
 g people who appreciate great music.\n\n**What you can expect:**\n\n* List
 en to a variety of original songs\, from heartfelt ballads and story songs
  to upbeat music you'll want to sing and dance along to\n* Meet fellow mus
 ic lovers in a welcoming\, social environment\n* Share thoughts\, ask ques
 tions\, and learn about the stories and inspiration behind the songs\n* En
 joy an entertaining evening filled with music\, conversation\, and new fri
 endships\n\n**About Steve Flemming**\nSteve Flemming is a Canadian songwri
 ter with a catalog of more than 1\,500 songs\, over 850 of which have been
  recorded. His music blends country\, folk\, roots\, rock\, and singer-son
 gwriter traditions\, ranging from thought-provoking story songs and heartf
 elt ballads to energetic\, feel-good songs that get people dancing and sin
 ging along. Inspired by everyday life\, relationships\, spirituality\, and
  the human experience\, Steve writes music that is both entertaining and m
 eaningful\, creating songs that connect with listeners long after the musi
 c ends.\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is 
 included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://
 Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n\n\\*If attending the 4:00 pm Family Feud eve
 nt that day there will be no additional entrance fee for the Listening Par
 ty event\n\n(One Beverage or Appetizer minimum please to support the venue
  and staff) (Plan to come for dinner too if you can)
