SUMMARY:Approaching and Ice Breaker Training
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nBack by popular demand!!\n\nYou wa
 lk in. You spot someone you want to meet.\n\nInstantly your brain goes bla
 nk. You freeze. The moment passes. Forever.\n\nSound familiar? That ends h
 ere.\n\nIn this virtual workshop you'll learn a dead-simple system that gi
 ves you a fresh\, natural opener every single time\, pulled straight from 
 the environment around you. No cheesy lines. No memorized scripts. Just a 
 reliable formula that works anywhere\, whether it’s dating\, pure social
  or business networking… this will work.\n\n**Here's what you'll walk aw
 ay with:**\n\n→ The Infinite Opener Formula: a field-tested method that 
 turns your surroundings into instant conversation starters. Walk into any 
 room and always know exactly what to say.\n\n→ The Body Language of the 
 Approach: how to carry yourself\, position your body\, and signal confiden
 ce before you even open your mouth.\n\n→ Your Personal Reference Workshe
 et: a take-home cheat sheet so the skill sticks long after the event ends.
 \n\nIf you came to some of my prior workshops\, you’ll love this one!\n\
 n**One workshop. Zero awkward silences for the rest of your life.**
